==Event Information==
Time to face off against the world's strongest fighters!<br>
The Battle Cats face off against the warriors of Street Fighter V: Champion Edition in a special crossover event!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Join the fight between November 28th (11am) and December 12th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・New characters and 2 new Capsules!'''}}<br>
New scrappy fighters aiming to be the best of the best have arrived!<br>
Two new Rare Capsules for Street Fighter V: Champion Edition are available: {{Color|#FF6D01|'''RED TEAM'''}} and {{Color|#00CCFF|'''BLUE TEAM'''}}!<br>
New to these Capsules are {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Sakura for the BLUE TEAM'''}} and {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Luke for the RED TEAM'''}}! The collaboration characters are exclusive to these Capsules, so now's your chance to add them to your army!

Characters on the {{Color|#00CCFF|'''BLUE TEAM'''}} include:<br>
[[Sakura (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Sakura (Uber Rare)'''}}]] {{Color|#FF6D01|'''NEW!!!'''}}<br>
Deals Massive damage to Traited enemies! (Omnistrike)<br>
[[Chun-Li (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00B8D9|'''Chun-Li (Uber Rare)'''}}]]
Kicks that Knockback Red, Black, and Alien enemies!<br>
[[Ken (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF991F|'''Ken (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs Red, Floating & Angels, with Knockback effect! (Omnistrike)<br>
[[Zangief (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#36B37E|'''Zangief (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Omnistrikes slam Zombies, preventing them from reviving! Plus, has a chance to dodge Zombie attacks!<br>
[[Dhalsim (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#BF2600|'''Dhalsim (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area strikes with 100% Weaken effect vs Traitless enemies!<br>
[[Sagat (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#339955|'''Sagat (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Massive strikes vs Floating that get stronger after taking damage!<br>
[[Vega (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Vega (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Freeze and Critical Metal Enemies! (Long Range Area Attack)

Characters on the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''RED TEAM'''}} include:<br>
[[Luke (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF991F|'''Luke (Uber Rare)'''}}]] {{Color|#FF991F|'''NEW!!!'''}}<br>
Strong against Traited enemies! (Area Attack)<br>
[[Ryu (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Ryu (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Smash enemies with Savage Blows! (Area Attack)<br>
[[Guile (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#36B37E|'''Guile (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Extra tough vs Floating, with Slow & Weaken effect! (Area Attack)<br>
[[Blanka (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00B8D9|'''Blanka (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Anti-Alien Omnistrikes! Crushes Barriers with ease! (Omnistrike)<br>
[[M. Bison (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#BF2600|'''M. Bison (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Floating and Aliens! (Omnistrike) Also breaks Barriers and can prevent Zombies from reviving!<br>
[[Balrog (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Balrog (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Mighty damage vs. only Red, Black & Zombie enemies! (Area Attack)<br>
[[E. Honda (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#6554C0|'''E. Honda (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Super tough vs Angels, with 100% Knockback! (Area Attack)

・The characters below will appear in both teams' Capsules!<br>
[[C. Honda (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#6554C0|'''N. Honda (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Angel enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Plus, Rare Cats "'''}}[[M. Bison Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''M. Bison Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6D01|'''", "'''}}[[Sagat Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Sagat Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6D01|'''", "'''}}[[Vega Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Vega Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6D01|'''", and "'''}}[[Balrog Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Balrog Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6D01|'''"!'''}}

※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Street Fighter V: Champion Edition" collab units from the "Street Fighter V: Champion Edition" capsule set. "Street Fighter V: Champion Edition"units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Street Fighter V: Champion Edition" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※ If "Street Fighter V: Champion Edition" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Master martial artists gather from around the globe for an epic tournament!<br>
Get ready for a crossover showdown vs a star-studded lineup of the fierce fighters of Street Fighter V: Champion Edition!

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Collab Map: "Street Fighter"'''}}<br>
Visit the Event Stages/Legend Stages to see the Street Fighter V: Champion Edition crossover stages!<br>
Travel the world to defeat a series of world-class opponents! Choose to challenge the {{Color|#36B37E|'''EASY'''}}, {{Color|#00CCFF|'''NORMAL'''}}, or {{Color|#FF6D01|'''HARD'''}} difficulty versions of each stage.<br>
Clear each stage as fast as you can to collect all the Timed Score rewards available!

※ Tap the Timed Score button on the map menu to preview the rewards available from these stages.<br>
Plus, clearing any stage will give you a chance to collect the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''limited edition character'''}} [[Ryu Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Ryu Cat'''}}]] as a stage drop reward!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Ryu Cat! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect Ryu Cat!)<br>
※ You can activate Ryu Cat at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!<br>
※Rewards that have been gained from a previous version of this event cannot be gained a second time.

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Special Collab Maps: "New Challenger"'''}}<br>
A mystery opponent awaits you for a warrior's duel!<br>
"New Challenger" stages will appear as a Blitz event throughout this collaboration at the following times!<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・6:00am ～ 7:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・9:00am ～ 10:59am'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・12:00pm ～ 1:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・3:00pm ～ 4:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・6:00pm ～ 7:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・9:00pm ～ 10:59pm'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・12:00am ～ 1:59am'''}}

A random hero from the cast of Street Fighter V: Champion Edition will appear to face your Cats in various New Challenger maps!<br>
Multiple difficulty versions of each stage will be available for you to take on!<br>
If you any defeat 4 opponents the final stage will appear with the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''ultimate fighter'''}} ready to punish your overconfidence!<br>
Prove your power and defeat this last boss for a chance to unlock a {{Color|#FF6D01|'''limited edition Collab unit'''}} as a clear reward!

※Get a 100% chance to collect stage rewards when you use the Treasure Radar item!<br>
※Rewards that have been gained from a previous version of this event cannot be gained a second time.

{{Color|#FF991F|'''・Collab Stage "Street Fighter (Very Hard)"'''}}<br>
By clearing specific stage, you can unlock the very tough stage called "Street Fighter (Very Hard)" and determine who is the strongest fighter in the world!

{{Color|#BF2600|'''●"I Seek the Strongest!" appears in the Arena of Honor'''}}<br>
Who is the greatest fighter of them all?!<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, a special "Street Fighter V:  Champion Edition" Dojo Ranking Event is here and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
Select {{Color|#BF2600|'''"I Seek the Strongest!"'''}} at the Catclaw Dojo and aim for the top score as you face off against mighty martial artists from this limited collab event! Plus, this updated revival of Dojo stage includes {{Color|#FF6D01|'''an all-new opponent'''}} to challenge!<br>
Climb to the highest ranks of the world warriors as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players! Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier.<br>
Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings! Do you have what it takes to be the strongest?

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Please be patient!
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.
※ Exiting the Battle screen during an Arena challenge will not restore spent Cat Food.
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor.
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.
※ If the Arena of Honor does not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit !'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards!<br>
Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Special Collab Unit "'''}}[[Chun-Li Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Chun-Li Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF6D01|'''"'''}} for your Cat Army!

※ You can activate Chun-Li Cat at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!

For more information on Street Fighter V: Champion Edition, visit the site below!<br>
